.Sh EXAMPLES
The BusyBox usage text gives these inetd configuration entries:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
21 stream tcp nowait root ftpd ftpd /files/to/serve
23 stream tcp wait root telnetd telnetd -w10
69 dgram udp nowait root tftpd tftpd -l /files/to/serve
.Ed
.Pp
It also gives these commands:
.Dl tcpsvd -vE 0.0.0.0 21 ftpd /files/to/serve
.Dl udpsvd -vE 0.0.0.0 69 tftpd /files/to/serve
.Dl hostname
.Dl nslookup localhost
